%% frame: Notifications B2 with A6, A7: relay one batch to SNS (design, commerce-svc)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Job as :OutboxRelayJob
    participant Run as :LeasedJobRunner
    participant Svc as :OutboxRelayService
    participant Repo as :OutboxRelayRepository
    participant T as :SnsOutboxEventTransport
    participant F as :OutboxMessageFactory
    participant Topic as domain-events (topic)
    participant Q as notification queue (queue)

    Note over Job,Run: B2: every 2 s; no transaction spans provider I/O
    Job->>Run: run(job, lease, work)
    alt another instance holds the lease outbox-relay (A7)
        Run-->>Job: skipped
    else lease taken for 2 min, renewed every 40 s
        Run->>Job: run(leaseValid): the job's lambda, a LeasedJobRunner.LeaseAwareWork
        Job->>Svc: relayBatch(leaseValid)
        Svc->>Repo: findDue(100)
        Repo-->>Svc: List<OutboxEvent>, oldest due first
        Svc->>T: publish(events, leaseValid)
        Note over T,F: final template method inherited from BatchingOutboxEventTransport
        loop each slice of 10 events, while leaseValid
            loop each event of the slice
                T->>T: entry(event)
                T->>F: body(event, json)
                F-->>T: IntegrationEventEnvelope as JSON
                T->>F: attributes(event)
                F-->>T: eventType, version, traceId
            end
            opt lease still valid (else the slice stays unattempted, A7)
                T->>T: send(events, entries)
                T->>Topic: PublishBatch(topicArn, entries)
                Topic-->>T: successful ids, failed ids
                Note over T,Q: SNS hop designed and unit-tested, not yet run on AWS (AISS-13); local and CI path SqsOutboxEventTransport to ElasticMQ, same consumer input (raw delivery)
                Topic-)Q: deliver(message), filter on eventType
            end
        end
        T-->>Svc: List<OutboxPublishResult>: published, failed or skipped
        Note over Svc,Repo: A6: a failed row gets attempts + 1 and a retry delay; the tenth failure marks it failed
        Svc->>Repo: recordResults(attempted, 10)
        Repo-->>Svc: int updated
        Svc-->>Job: int
    end
